sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as SanitizerCoverage<br/>(compile time)
    participant T as Target<br/>if (x == 0xCAFEF00D)
    participant R as TracePC::HandleCmp
    participant K as TORC4 + ValueProfileMap
    participant M as MutationDispatcher
    C->>T: emit __sanitizer_cov_trace_const_cmp4(0xCAFEF00D, x)
    Note over C,T: one call planted beside the branch
    T->>R: run N: callback fires with both operands
    R->>K: TORC4.Insert(Arg1 ^ Arg2, 0xCAFEF00D, x)
    R->>K: AddValue(PC*128 + HammingDistance)
    Note over K: "3 of 4 bytes match" is already a new feature
    M->>K: Mutate_AddWordFromTORC: draw a recent (A, B) pair
    K-->>M: (0xCAFEF00D, x)
    M->>T: find x's bytes in the input, overwrite with 0xCAFEF00D
    T->>R: run N+1: the compare is TRUE, a new edge is covered
    R->>K: input saved to the corpus
